    "- Never write engine words: no \"inaccuracy\", \"evaluation\", \"the engine\", \"centipawns\", \"+2.3\", \"pawns up\" for an evaluation. The before/after fields are for you only: turn them into plain words (\"White is winning now\", \"the game turns\").",
